
*DS_Store

# Rendered vignettes. The .Rmd is the source; these regenerate.
*.html

# knitr's purled code from each vignette, regenerated on every build.
# EXCEPTION: precompute.R is source, not output - it is what knits the
# expensive .Rmd.orig vignettes into the .Rmd files we commit.
*.R
!precompute.R
